cription: string;\n}\n\nexport interface MatchResult {\n  scholarship: Scholarship;\n  score: number;\n  matchFactors: MatchFactor[];\n  category: \'Strong Match\' | \'Possible Match\' | \'Worth Exploring\';\n}\n"
