  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Vibrant Palette\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Vibrant Palette\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-slate-50 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-[#4F2D7F] text-white flex items-center justify-between px-8 shadow-md border-b-4 border-[#E8C84A]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-7 h-7 text-[#4F2D7F]\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z\\\" />\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase\\\">Western Scholarship Finder</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#ffffff20] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full\\\"></span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">User: Jane Mustang</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\\\">Sign Out</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex p-6 gap-6 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar: Profile Data (Step 1 Representation) -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-[320px] bg-white rounded-[32px] shadow-lg border border-slate-200 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-[#4F2D7F] text-white\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">Your Profile</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-purple-200\\\">Refine your details to update matches</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 p-5 space-y-4 overflow-y-auto text-sm\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Year & Faculty</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg text-slate-700\\\">3rd Year</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg text-slate-700\\\">Social Science</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Program / Major</label>\\n          <p class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Political Science & International Relations</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Academic Status</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-2 border-2 border-[#4F2D7F20] bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">GPA: 85\342\200\22389%</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-[#4F2D7F] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase\\\">High</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Identity & Interests</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs\\\">Woman</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold\\\">Leadership</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs text-green-600 font-semibold\\\">Volunteering</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs\\\">Athletics</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pt-4\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full py-3 bg-[#E8C84A] text-[#4F2D7F] font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:brightness-105 active:scale-95 transition-all\\\">\\n            Edit Profile Info\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Content: Scholarship Results (Step 3) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between px-2\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">Matches Found <span class=\\\"text-slate-400 text-xl font-normal ml-2\\\">(12 total)</span></h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-slate-500 text-sm\\\">Sorted by eligibility and profile alignment.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"p-2 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M3 3a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 011 1v3a1 1 0 01-.293.707L12 11.414V15a1 1 0 01-.293.707l-2 2A1 1 0 018 17v-5.586L3.293 6.707A1 1 0 013 6V3z\\\" /></svg>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"p-2 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 4a1 1 0 00-2 0v7.268a2 2 0 000 3.464V16a1 1 0 102 0v-1.268a2 2 0 000-3.464V4zM11 4a1 1 0 10-2 0v1.268a2 2 0 000 3.464V16a1 1 0 102 0V8.732a2 2 0 000-3.464V4zM16 3a1 1 0 011 1v7.268a2 2 0 010 3.464V16a1 1 0 11-2 0v-1.268a2 2 0 010-3.464V4a1 1 0 011-1z\\\" /></svg>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 pr-2\\\">\\n        <!-- Strong Match Card -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border-l-8 border-green-500 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm flex gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-r border-slate-100 pr-6\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-green-600\\\">92</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Match Score</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-3 px-2 py-1 bg-green-50 text-green-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md\\\">STRONG</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-1\\\">\\n              <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">The Global Leader Entrance Award</h3>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-800\\\">$12,000</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-3\\\">Western University Alumni Association</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Why you matched:</p>\\n                <ul class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full\\\"></span> Top Tier GPA (85%+) </li>\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full\\\"></span> Leadership Track Record </li>\\n                </ul>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Deadline:</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">October 15, 2024</p>\\n                <button class=\\\"mt-1 text-[#4F2D7F] font-bold underline underline-offset-4\\\">Apply Online &rarr;</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Possible Match Card -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border-l-8 border-blue-400 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm flex gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow opacity-95\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-r border-slate-100 pr-6\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-500\\\">74</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Match Score</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-3 px-2 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md\\\">POSSIBLE</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-1\\\">\\n              <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">Social Sciences Excellence Grant</h3>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-800\\\">$4,500</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-3\\\">Faculty of Social Science</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Why you matched:</p>\\n                <ul class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-300 rounded-full\\\"></span> Faculty Alignment </li>\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-300 rounded-full\\\"></span> Ontario Residency </li>\\n                </ul>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Deadline:</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">December 1, 2024</p>\\n                <button class=\\\"mt-1 text-[#4F2D7F] font-bold underline underline-offset-4\\\">View Details &rarr;</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Another Result -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-slate-100 border-l-8 border-slate-300 rounded-3xl p-4 shadow-none flex gap-6 opacity-75\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-r border-slate-200 pr-6\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-400\\\">51</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Match Score</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-500\\\">Community Impact Bursary</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Matching on Volunteerism interest. Missing financial need criteria.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Footer Disclaimer -->\\n      <footer class=\\\"py-3 px-4 bg-[#4F2D7F10] rounded-2xl border border-[#4F2D7F20]\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 italic text-center\\\">\\n          Disclaimer: This tool suggests scholarships you may be eligible for based on available data. Always verify specific eligibility requirements and deadlines on the official Western University or provider website before starting an application.\\n        </p>\\n      </footer>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Vibrant Palette\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Vibrant Palette\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-slate-50 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-[#4F2D7F] text-white flex items-center justify-between px-8 shadow-md border-b-4 border-[#E8C84A]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-7 h-7 text-[#4F2D7F]\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z\\\" />\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase\\\">Western Scholarship Finder</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#ffffff20] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full\\\"></span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">User: Jane Mustang</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\\\">Sign Out</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex p-6 gap-6 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar: Profile Data (Step 1 Representation) -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-[320px] bg-white rounded-[32px] shadow-lg border border-slate-200 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-[#4F2D7F] text-white\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">Your Profile</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-purple-200\\\">Refine your details to update matches</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 p-5 space-y-4 overflow-y-auto text-sm\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Year & Faculty</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg text-slate-700\\\">3rd Year</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg text-slate-700\\\">Social Science</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Program / Major</label>\\n          <p class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Political Science & International Relations</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Academic Status</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-2 border-2 border-[#4F2D7F20] bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">GPA: 85\342\200\22389%</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-[#4F2D7F] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase\\\">High</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider\\\">Identity & Interests</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs\\\">Woman</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold\\\">Leadership</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs text-green-600 font-semibold\\\">Volunteering</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-xs\\\">Athletics</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pt-4\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full py-3 bg-[#E8C84A] text-[#4F2D7F] font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:brightness-105 active:scale-95 transition-all\\\">\\n            Edit Profile Info\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Content: Scholarship Results (Step 3) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-end justify-between px-2\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">Matches Found <span class=\\\"text-slate-400 text-xl font-normal ml-2\\\">(12 total)</span></h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-slate-500 text-sm\\\">Sorted by eligibility and profile alignment.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"p-2 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M3 3a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 011 1v3a1 1 0 01-.293.707L12 11.414V15a1 1 0 01-.293.707l-2 2A1 1 0 018 17v-5.586L3.293 6.707A1 1 0 013 6V3z\\\" /></svg>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"p-2 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 4a1 1 0 00-2 0v7.268a2 2 0 000 3.464V16a1 1 0 102 0v-1.268a2 2 0 000-3.464V4zM11 4a1 1 0 10-2 0v1.268a2 2 0 000 3.464V16a1 1 0 102 0V8.732a2 2 0 000-3.464V4zM16 3a1 1 0 011 1v7.268a2 2 0 010 3.464V16a1 1 0 11-2 0v-1.268a2 2 0 010-3.464V4a1 1 0 011-1z\\\" /></svg>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 pr-2\\\">\\n        <!-- Strong Match Card -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border-l-8 border-green-500 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm flex gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-r border-slate-100 pr-6\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-green-600\\\">92</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Match Score</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-3 px-2 py-1 bg-green-50 text-green-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md\\\">STRONG</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-1\\\">\\n              <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">The Global Leader Entrance Award</h3>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-800\\\">$12,000</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-3\\\">Western University Alumni Association</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Why you matched:</p>\\n                <ul class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full\\\"></span> Top Tier GPA (85%+) </li>\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-400 rounded-full\\\"></span> Leadership Track Record </li>\\n                </ul>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Deadline:</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">October 15, 2024</p>\\n                <button class=\\\"mt-1 text-[#4F2D7F] font-bold underline underline-offset-4\\\">Apply Online &rarr;</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Possible Match Card -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border-l-8 border-blue-400 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm flex gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow opacity-95\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-r border-slate-100 pr-6\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-500\\\">74</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Match Score</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-3 px-2 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md\\\">POSSIBLE</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-1\\\">\\n              <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-[#4F2D7F]\\\">Social Sciences Excellence Grant</h3>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-800\\\">$4,500</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-3\\\">Faculty of Social Science</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Why you matched:</p>\\n                <ul class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-300 rounded-full\\\"></span> Faculty Alignment </li>\\n                  <li class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600\\\"> <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-300 rounded-full\\\"></span> Ontario Residency </li>\\n                </ul>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold text-[10px]\\\">Deadline:</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">December 1, 2024</p>\\n                <button class=\\\"mt-1 text-[#4F2D7F] font-bold underline underline-offset-4\\\">View Details &rarr;</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Another Result -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-slate-100 border-l-8 border-slate-300 rounded-3xl p-4 shadow-none flex gap-6 opacity-75\\\">\\n          <di